# Production cluster parameters: pitch 200 -> cluster size 20000, expand margin 1000.
# One net: A [0,18999] abuts B [18999,20500], both 100 tall. The full polygon is
# 20500*100 = 2050000 >= 300000, so it is legal. The cluster at x >= 20000 only
# receives B (A enlarged by 1000 ends at 19999), whose area is 1501*100 = 150100.
case minimum_area_split_polygon
die 0 0 100000 100000
routing M1 dir=H pitch=200 min_area=300000
cut V1
result n1 M1 0 0 18999 100
result n1 M1 18999 0 20500 100
expect none
